	 * - Strengthen the bridge around chk.spec_valid to include additional internal
	 *   state that must coincide with an ADD retirement (e.g. cpu_state sequencing
	 *   around fetch/ld_rs/exec and decoder_trigger/mem_done timing), but without
	 *   directly re-asserting o_*.
